Cell["\<\
A complete connection chooses a perfect matching between the whole fibers \
over every base edge, using only transverse total edges.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d8194566-4375-4640-8771-5e2eccf53d87"],

Cell["\<\
Unequal neighbouring fiber sizes or a perfect-matching obstruction give an \
empty result. An invalid partial matching is never returned as a connection.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8b96eb97-58f2-4a7b-90ff-02c3bdc0f1d2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Omitted count or Automatic returns one ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraConnection"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraConnection", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2b7bdc4e-305a-4e40-b377-9366762ed561"],
 " directly. An integer ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " returns exactly ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " distinct connections, or {} on shortage. UpTo[",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 "] returns at most ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 ". All enumerates the class."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"919db7a3-7571-4628-9f76-b78789be29c7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On an empty base there is one connection, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraConnection"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraConnection", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "aead9c5e-4751-4c1f-a8b7-7e1365e7b257"],
 ". An empty result list means that no member was returned."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"aa2aaeea-c910-4993-b599-8f99defdd979"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"RandomSeeding", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3caa11f6-e05f-4117-91db-e73a710d37b4"],
 " (default) seeds each call afresh, independently of ",
