  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8e193537-fb1b-49d1-afb3-bf5850b152e1"],
 " a local snapshot of the current state. The outer random state is restored \
afterward, as with ",
 ButtonBox["RandomInstance",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/RandomInstance.html"], 
    None}],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e04e94ab-b411-4c81-a02d-fdbb5205a2e8"],

Cell["\<\
Search processes base edges and source fiber vertices in their graph orders. \
At each step, candidates are unused target vertices whose choice admits a \
completion of that matching. A bounded search stops once it has enough \
members.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5d4207f1-760f-44c5-a9f7-bfacab1c2094"],

Cell["\<\
Random candidate order does not give a uniform distribution over completed \
connections.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9e1cc474-6cb8-4bcc-a3e9-5c90ce3b1089"],

